<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="节假日和习俗"><span id=".E8.8A.82.E5.81.87.E6.97.A5.E5.92.8C.E4.B9.A0.E4.BF.97"></span>节假日和习俗</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=1%E6%9C%881%E6%97%A5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="编辑章节：节假日和习俗"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<ul><li><a href="/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C" title="世界">世界</a>上大多数国家的<a href="/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E5%B9%B4" title="新年">新年</a>，<a href="/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87" class="mw-redirect" title="中文">中文</a>称为“<a href="/wiki/%E5%85%83%E6%97%A6" title="元旦">元旦</a>”，这一天是<a href="/wiki/%E5%85%AC%E6%9B%86" class="mw-redirect" title="公历">公历</a>新一年的开始。</li>
<li><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border notpageimage" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href="/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E8%8F%AF%E6%B0%91%E5%9C%8B" title="中华民国">中华民国</a>：<a href="/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E8%8F%AF%E6%B0%91%E5%9C%8B%E9%96%8B%E5%9C%8B%E7%B4%80%E5%BF%B5%E6%97%A5" title="中华民国开国纪念日">开国纪念日</a></li>
<li><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border notpageimage" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Flag_of_Cuba.svg/40px-Flag_of_Cuba.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="11" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Flag_of_Cuba.svg/60px-Flag_of_Cuba.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href="/wiki/%E5%8F%A4%E5%B7%B4" title="古巴">古巴</a>：<a href="/wiki/%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD%E8%83%9C%E5%88%A9" title="革命胜利">革命胜利日</a></li>
<li><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border notpageimage" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Flag_of_Sudan.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sudan.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="11" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Flag_of_Sudan.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sudan.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href="/wiki/%E8%8B%8F%E4%B8%B9" title="苏丹">苏丹</a>：<a href="/wiki/%E5%9B%BD%E5%BA%86%E6%97%A5" title="国庆日">国庆日</a></li>
